IDD_ABOUT DIALOGEX 0, 0, 278, 211
STYLE DS_SETFONT | DS_MODALFRAME | DS_NOIDLEMSG | DS_SETFOREGROUND | DS_NOFAILCREATE | DS_CENTER | WS_POPUP | WS_CAPTION | WS_SYSMENU
CAPTION "About BriskPlayer"
